      "note": "OPENING DESIGNED + WRITTEN — LO approved (the first write under the propose-first rule). Added '## The opening (design)' to design_book.md. SHAPE = 3 beats, ~23 nodes, ON-RAILS (Continue) until ONE hinge node ('out the door') that opens the city — the cage mirrors her no-will state. SUPERSEDES the turn-2 bed->cradle opening sketch. BEAT 1 office (~12 nodes): failed op (she FROZE = the first glitch, read as a malfunction) -> threat to scrap -> she begs -> too-valuable ('the Chairman's investment', NAMES the Chairman) -> punishment-FUCK in front of the 3 units (she FEELS it, they're BLANK = the half-human mirror) -> gratitude -> reassignment (Vega/Lyra/Nova -> head-on hunt; her -> infiltration, 'useless with a gun but...') + MISSION FRAMING (the rogue MURDERED the CHAIRMAN'S WIFE, enemy of company+world) -> dismissed. Introduces Mercer/units/Chairman/rogue/her through ACTION, not exposition. BEAT 2 night (~7 nodes, FULLY LINEAR — LO killed the flavor-choices): walk back -> cradle (charge/save/day-reset) -> TEARS (her body cries, she can't explain it = the tell) -> memory LEAK (a fragment) -> CATECHISM (the lie she believes: machine, saved, owes, obeys) -> THE POWER (control at his climax, company-given; NEVER works on the boss, unquestioned) -> power-down (retreat into the leash). BEAT 3 morning (~4 nodes): power-up -> phone briefing -> the tip (Renner @ the Anchor) -> OUT THE DOOR (the hinge: cover/disguise + the map opens) -> Renner. CRAFT NOTES recorded: render-don't-dump (iceberg; a fragment, not a flashback) / crying=malfunction (preserves 'blank except the sex') / belief-vs-truth (write her self-concept straight, NEVER confirm it) / on-rails mirrors surrender. PARKED CHEKHOV GUNS: (1) what really happened to the Chairman's wife (the 'rogue killed her' = company LIE that keeps Cain good; truth TBD); (2) why the weapon fails on the boss [CANDIDATE, not locked: it needs a SELF to fire -> none present in total surrender -> wires the Act-2 used->user turn]; (3) the Chairman's motive = GRIEF [optional seed]. deep_design.player -> in_progress (opening/bootstrap done; the rest of the player thread — explicit wants/economy/ceiling/routines — still pending). book_revision -> 11."
