      "note": "SEED LOCKED (Step 0+1). POV: female PC. Fantasy: a cold, lobotomized machine honeypot weapon of Vance Dynamics, recovering a stolen self while toppling the empire that owns her. Charge = transformation (machine reclaiming amputated feeling) + conquest (break-and-own the company) + cold-machine taboo (shameless honeypot, sex-as-data-mining). Desire span = mostly men (the company's old-boys structure), cold/transactional default, ONE reserved thaw saved for the rogue machine at the end."
