    {
      "turn": 2,
      "book_revision": 2,
      "note": "MENTAL STATE: she starts in TOTAL SURRENDER — a will-less owned servant who believes serving the company/boss is all she is; NO motive of her own; her motive = the company's. The whole game is her motive peeling away from theirs (zero -> her own will, against them). The surrender is itself a fantasy (owned/obedient), not just setup. OPENING (fixed): boss's bed (body responds, mind cold) -> dismissed -> her room -> charging cradle -> surrender thought + first glitch (she's THINKING about who she is). The charger = hub/day-reset AND where memories leak."
