    {
      "turn": 3,
      "book_revision": 3,
      "note": "CORE ADDITIONS LOCKED: (1) She LOVES sex — the ONE thing she feels; everything else is blank (NOT contentment — they hollowed her out, left one spark; the chip hints there was a whole person). (2) THE SECRET WEAPON: during the sex act she can DOSE a man pliable and DRAIN his secrets, and it RUNS ON HER OWN PLEASURE (she must mean it). This fuses fantasy+mission: she wins by submitting — he uses her while she empties him out. Exact dose/drain mechanics still to finalize. (3) The masks rhyme with the mystery: she wears a false self per mission while her real self is erased; the chip is her true identity surfacing under the covers — infiltration theme = awakening theme."
