    },
    {
      "turn": 3,
      "book_revision": 3,
      "note": "NAMES LOCKED + boss decided. Phase-1 mission targets: Renner (ran the EVIL FACILITY Cain destroyed; covers it up; caretaker cover) -> Bastien (docks dealer, Cain's supply; submissive cover) -> Calloway (Vance insider w/ the file, secretly craves submission; DOMME cover). THE BOSS = MERCER — her direct owner AND handler (owns her inside: sex+chores; runs her missions; cruel; knows ALL her secrets = the danger when she cracks); SEPARATE and BELOW the Chairman (keeps the Chairman the remote Act-2 apex + the 'who's behind this' mystery). The old separate Handler role is MERGED into Mercer. Lena retired (folded into the chip + Mission 1 cover-up). ECONOMY formalized in book: no rent; pressure = the leash + cost of going off-book; light in Phase 1, ignites Act 2, hunted endgame; one wallet; leash = the §8 fail-state."
    },
    {
      "turn": 4,
      "book_revision": 4,
      "note": "WEAPON LOCKED (mechanics + engine implementation). She must MEAN the sex (her own pleasure powers it). Trigger = HE CLIMAXES INSIDE HER -> she passes a fluid -> FULL CONTROL of him. Both = drain his secrets AND command him. ENGINE IMPLEMENTATION (LO, no real timer — engine is canvas-based): his climax routes to a CONTROL CANVAS (she questions/commands/drains = the extraction); when that canvas ENDS, ~10 fiction-minutes have passed and HE REMEMBERS NOTHING (wakes clean, mark reusable). The control canvas = the payoff scene of EVERY infiltration. Used ONLY on targets, NEVER the boss in Phase 1 (she stays surrendered) — it's the one thing that's HERS. Act-2 seed: the day she turns it on Mercer, used->user. MERCER CONFIRMED by LO (separate boss below the Chairman)."
    },
    {
      "turn": 5,
      "book_revision": 5,
      "note": "STAT SET LOCKED (every stat gates real content; LO trimmed aggressively). PLAYER METERS: money (credits, the one wallet) + charge (= engine energy reskinned; paces day, vulnerability when hunted). INVENTORY: capabilities/upgrades = items (buyable loadout, owns-gate) + chip/memories = items (collectibles + a memories view). PER-TARGET LOCK = relation + corruption (NPC built-in traits; exact use per character at casting): relation = the INFILTRATION (embedded under cover, works for him, trusted) ; corruption = the SEDUCTION (hooked/compromised -> extends to 'owned' in Act 2). Both high -> he beds her -> the weapon. NPC AROUSAL REMOVED. DELIBERATELY NONE: her arousal, a feeling/humanity meter, a heat/suspicion meter. KEY PRINCIPLE (LO): don't add a stat later that isn't used now — so corruption is present from Phase 1 (seduction->ownership), and heat/suspicion is REMOVED entirely (the company's leash/crackdown handled by STORY BEATS + FLAGS, not a meter). Stat set done; only pacing/frontier left in Step 2, then Step 2b map."
    },
    {
      "turn": 6,
      "book_revision": 6,
      "note": "SCOPE + FRONTIER (LO): building PHASE 1 ONLY for now (up to the chip / the fracture). Phase 1 ends on a CLIFFHANGER (the fracture into Act 2), not a frontier-plateau — correct for a slice toward the whole. PACING/FRONTIER (kill-or-love peak + livable post-game plateau + endless-sandbox signpost) PARKED as a known open question for Act-2 design, NOT skipped. Phase-1 pacing already carried by the web (mission loop + escalating dread -> fracture). Step 2 effectively done for Phase 1. ADVANCED pipeline_phase -> map_design (Step 2b)."
    },
    {
      "turn": 7,
      "book_revision": 7,
      "note": "COMPANY IDENTITY LOCKED (LO: public face = robotics/AI). Vance Dynamics, 3 layers: (1) PUBLIC = prestige robotics/AI megacorp (explains labs/scientists/thousands of staff); (2) REAL BUSINESS = OWNERSHIP — uses human-derived ASSETS like Wren to run the world's top intelligence-and-control op, owning the powerful via extracted secrets (the missions ARE the core business); (3) DEEPEST (Act-2) = the asset program is the Chairman's immortality machine. Theme = a company whose whole trade is OWNING PEOPLE; the PC is a person it owns, waking up. NEW SETUP (seeded for Act 2, light Phase-1 role): everyone LIVES INSIDE the company (a vertical TOWER/arcology; Chairman does NOT live here); a LAB SCIENTIST (in-house roboticist — upgrades + origin thread; Phase-1: flags her glitching); THREE UNITS (human-derived assets, better hardware/lesser minds/no soul — Wren is the irreplaceable ORIGINAL; 'only you can be better' = reclaim the soul = the awakening; Phase-1: a mirror/dread)."
